Rejects invalid graphs, escaping paths and conflicting managed identities

Usage: leptoskit workspace check [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --manifest <MANIFEST>  Workspace manifest; otherwise find leptoskit.workspace.toml in this directory or a parent. Application paths are relative to that file
      --json                 Emit a versioned JSON report without secret values
  -h, --help                 Print help
  -V, --version              Print version
